<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#00234C">
  <title>Portal de Acceso Institucional | Policía de Investigaciones de Chile</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/assets/logo-pdi.png">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:wght,FILL@100..700,0..1&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.2/css/all.min.css">
  
  <style>
    :root {
      --pdi-navy: #00234C;
      --pdi-navy-dark: #001733;
      --pdi-navy-light: #0A366D;
      --pdi-gold: #FFD100;
      --pdi-gold-dark: #C69214;
      --pdi-gold-hover: #FFE033;
      --pdi-blue: #0056B8;
      --pdi-blue-hover: #006CE8;
      
      --text-main: #0F172A;
      --text-muted: #334155;
      --text-light: #64748B;
      
      --bg-page: #F1F5F9;
      --bg-card: #FFFFFF;
      --border-card: #CBD5E1;
      --border-card-hover: #94A3B8;
      
      --font-scale: 1;
    }

    /* Modo Alto Contraste */
    body.high-contrast {
      --text-main: #000000;
      --text-muted: #111827;
      --border-card: #00234C;
      --bg-page: #E2E8F0;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
      background-color: var(--bg-page);
      background-image: 
        radial-gradient(at 0% 0%, rgba(10, 54, 109, 0.08) 0px, transparent 50%),
        radial-gradient(at 100% 100%, rgba(255, 209, 0, 0.08) 0px, transparent 50%),
        linear-gradient(rgba(0, 35, 76, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 35, 76, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 100% 100%, 100% 100%, 40px 40px, 40px 40px;
      color: var(--text-main);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      font-size: calc(16px * var(--font-scale));
      line-height: 1.5;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    /* =========================================================
       BARRA INSTITUCIONAL SUPERIOR (ENCABEZADO DE GOBIERNO/PDI)
       ========================================================= */
    .top-header {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #001C3D 0%, #00234C 100%);
      border-bottom: 4px solid var(--pdi-gold);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0, 35, 76, 0.25);
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
    }

    .top-header-inner {
      max-width: 1320px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 20px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .header-brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .header-logo-box {
      width: 54px;
      height: 54px;
      background: #FFFFFF;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 6px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
      border: 2px solid var(--pdi-gold);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .header-logo-box img {
      max-width: 100%;
      max-height: 100%;
      object-fit: contain;
    }

    .header-brand-text h1 {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #FFFFFF;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .header-brand-text p {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--pdi-gold);
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    /* Controles de Accesibilidad para Personas Adultas */
    .header-accessibility-tools {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .font-size-control {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 4px;
      gap: 4px;
    }

    .font-size-label {
      color: #FFFFFF;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 0 8px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }

    .btn-font-size {
      background: #FFFFFF;
      color: var(--pdi-navy);
      border: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 13px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.15s ease;
      min-width: 34px;
    }

    .btn-font-size:hover {
      background: var(--pdi-gold);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .btn-font-size.active {
      background: var(--pdi-gold);
      color: var(--pdi-navy-dark);
      box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 209, 0, 0.6);
    }

    .header-clock {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
      color: #FFFFFF;
      padding: 8px 16px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-family: ui-monospace, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    .clock-dot {
      width: 9px;
      height: 9px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #10B981;
      box-shadow: 0 0 8px #10B981;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    /* =========================================================
       CONTENIDO PRINCIPAL / SELECCIONADOR DE SISTEMAS
       ========================================================= */
    .portal-container {
      flex: 1;
      max-width: 1280px;
      width: 100%;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 40px 24px 60px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    /* Encabezado del Portal con Alta Visibilidad */
    .portal-banner {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      max-width: 900px;
    }

    .portal-kicker {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      background: #FFFFFF;
      color: var(--pdi-navy);
      border: 2px solid var(--pdi-navy);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 8px 20px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(0, 35, 76, 0.08);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .portal-kicker i {
      color: var(--pdi-gold-dark);
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .portal-main-title {
      font-size: calc(34px * var(--font-scale));
      font-weight: 900;
      color: var(--pdi-navy);
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .portal-instructions {
      font-size: calc(18px * var(--font-scale));
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.6;
      font-weight: 500;
      max-width: 780px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    /* Indicador de Sesión Existente */
    .user-session-alert {
      background: #EFF6FF;
      border: 2px solid #BFDBFE;
      color: #1E3A8A;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 14px 22px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      font-size: calc(15px * var(--font-scale));
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(30, 58, 138, 0.06);
    }

    .user-session-alert strong {
      color: #1D4ED8;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    /* =========================================================
       GRILLA DE TARJETAS DE SISTEMAS (ALTO CONTRASTE Y LEGIBILIDAD)
       ========================================================= */
    .systems-selector-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 36px;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1140px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    /* Tarjeta Individual */
    .system-selection-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border-radius: 20px;
      border: 3px solid var(--border-card);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 35, 76, 0.08), 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 35, 76, 0.04);
      padding: 40px 36px 36px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      position: relative;
      transition: all 0.25s ease-in-out;
    }

    .system-selection-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(0, 35, 76, 0.16);
    }

    /* Tarjeta ABIS */
    .card-theme-abis {
      border-top: 8px solid var(--pdi-gold-dark);
    }

    .card-theme-abis:hover {
      border-color: var(--pdi-gold-dark);
    }

    /* Tarjeta SIAD */
    .card-theme-siad {
      border-top: 8px solid var(--pdi-blue);
    }

    .card-theme-siad:hover {
      border-color: var(--pdi-blue);
    }

    /* Encabezado de la Tarjeta */
    .card-header-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .card-icon-container {
      width: 76px;
      height: 76px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    }

    .icon-abis-box {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFF8DB 0%, #FFE98A 100%);
      color: #946F00;
      border: 2px solid #E6BA00;
    }

    .icon-siad-box {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #E6F0FF 0%, #CCE1FF 100%);
      color: #004B99;
      border: 2px solid #66A3FF;
    }

    .card-icon-container .material-symbols-outlined {
      font-size: 44px;
    }

    .card-title-block {
      flex: 1;
    }

    .badge-category {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .badge-cat-abis {
      background: #FEF9C3;
      color: #854D0E;
      border: 1px solid #FDE047;
    }

    .badge-cat-siad {
      background: #DBEAFE;
      color: #1E40AF;
      border: 1px solid #BFDBFE;
    }

    .system-title-text {
      font-size: calc(30px * var(--font-scale));
      font-weight: 900;
      color: var(--pdi-navy);
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      line-height: 1.1;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .version-tag {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      background: #E2E8F0;
      color: #475569;
      padding: 3px 8px;
      border-radius: 6px;
    }

    .system-subtitle-text {
      font-size: calc(16px * var(--font-scale));
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--pdi-navy-light);
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    /* Descripción y Funciones */
    .card-body-content {
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .card-description-paragraph {
      font-size: calc(16px * var(--font-scale));
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .features-list-title {
      font-size: calc(14px * var(--font-scale));
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      color: var(--pdi-navy);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .system-features-list {
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .feature-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 12px;
      font-size: calc(15px * var(--font-scale));
      color: var(--text-main);
      line-height: 1.45;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .feature-check {
      width: 24px;
      height: 24px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      margin-top: 1px;
    }

    .check-abis {
      background: #FEF08A;
      color: #854D0E;
    }

    .check-siad {
      background: #BFDBFE;
      color: #1E40AF;
    }

    .feature-check i {
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    /* Botones de Acción Extra Grandes y Visibles */
    .card-action-container {
      margin-top: auto;
    }

    .btn-system-portal {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 14px;
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 64px;
      padding: 16px 28px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: calc(18px * var(--font-scale));
      font-weight: 900;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
      border: 2px solid transparent;
      text-align: center;
    }

    /* Botón ABIS */
    .btn-portal-abis {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFD826 0%, #F5BE00 100%);
      color: #00234C;
      border-color: #E6B200;
    }

    .btn-portal-abis:hover {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFE566 0%, #FFD100 100%);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(255, 209, 0, 0.45);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      color: #001733;
    }

    /* Botón SIAD */
    .btn-portal-siad {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0066DC 0%, #004FA8 100%);
      color: #FFFFFF;
      border-color: #004494;
    }

    .btn-portal-siad:hover {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #1A7BEE 0%, #005DC7 100%);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(0, 86, 184, 0.4);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      color: #FFFFFF;
    }

    .btn-system-portal .btn-arrow-icon {
      font-size: 22px;
      transition: transform 0.2s ease;
    }

    .btn-system-portal:hover .btn-arrow-icon {
      transform: translateX(6px);
    }

    /* =========================================================
       AVISO DE PRIVACIDAD / SEGURIDAD INSTITUCIONAL
       ========================================================= */
    .security-notice-box {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1140px;
      background: #FFFFFF;
      border: 2px solid #CBD5E1;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 20px 28px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0, 35, 76, 0.04);
    }

    .security-icon-circle {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: #FEF3C7;
      border: 2px solid #FDE68A;
      color: #92400E;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .security-icon-circle i {
      font-size: 22px;
    }

    .security-notice-text h4 {
      font-size: calc(15px * var(--font-scale));
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--pdi-navy);
      margin-bottom: 3px;
    }

    .security-notice-text p {
      font-size: calc(14px * var(--font-scale));
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    /* =========================================================
       PIE DE PÁGINA INSTITUCIONAL
       ========================================================= */
    .portal-site-footer {
      background: #001733;
      color: #CBD5E1;
      border-top: 3px solid var(--pdi-gold);
      padding: 28px 24px;
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: auto;
    }

    .footer-inner-content {
      max-width: 1140px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .footer-legal-text {
      font-size: calc(13px * var(--font-scale));
      color: #94A3B8;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .footer-copyright {
      font-size: calc(14px * var(--font-scale));
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #FFFFFF;
    }

    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width: 960px) {
      .systems-selector-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 28px;
      }
      .top-header-inner {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 14px;
      }
      .header-accessibility-tools {
        width: 100%;
        justify-content: space-between;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- =========================================================
       ENCABEZADO INSTITUCIONAL PDI
       ========================================================= -->
  <header class="top-header">
    <div class="top-header-inner">
      <div class="header-brand">
        <div class="header-logo-box">
          <img src="/assets/logo-pdi.png" alt="Escudo PDI">
        </div>
        <div class="header-brand-text">
          <h1>Policía de Investigaciones de Chile</h1>
          <p>Jefatura Nacional de Inteligencia Policial · JENAPOL</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Barra de accesibilidad para personas adultas / jefaturas -->
      <div class="header-accessibility-tools">
        <div class="font-size-control">
          <span class="font-size-label"><i class="fa-solid fa-text-height"></i> Texto:</span>
          <button type="button" class="btn-font-size" onclick="setFontScale(0.95)" title="Texto normal" id="btn-scale-sm">A</button>
          <button type="button" class="btn-font-size active" onclick="setFontScale(1.1)" title="Texto mediano" id="btn-scale-md">A+</button>
          <button type="button" class="btn-font-size" onclick="setFontScale(1.25)" title="Texto grande" id="btn-scale-lg">A++</button>
        </div>

        <button type="button" class="btn-font-size" onclick="toggleHighContrast()" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); color: #fff; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3); padding: 6px 12px;" title="Alternar contraste">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-half-stroke"></i> Contraste
        </button>

        <div class="header-clock">
          <span class="clock-dot"></span>
          <span id="relojChile">--:--:--</span>
          <span style="color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;">SCL</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- =========================================================
       CUERPO PRINCIPAL DEL PORTAL
       ========================================================= -->
  <main class="portal-container">

    <!-- Mensaje y Pregunta Principal -->
    <div class="portal-banner">
      <div class="portal-kicker">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i>
        <span>Portal Único de Acceso Operativo</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="portal-main-title">¿A qué sistema desea ingresar?</h2>
      <p class="portal-instructions">
        Haga clic en la plataforma que corresponda a sus funciones periciales o investigativas para iniciar sesión y ser redirigido directamente a su panel de trabajo.
      </p>
    </div>

    <% if (typeof user !== 'undefined' && user) { %>
      <div class="user-session-alert">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check" style="font-size: 20px; color: #2563EB;"></i>
        <span>Usted cuenta con una sesión activa en este equipo como <strong><%= user.username %></strong> (<%= user.rol %>).</span>
      </div>
    <% } %>

    <!-- =========================================================
         GRILLA DE SELECCIÓN: ABIS vs SIAD
         ========================================================= -->
    <div class="systems-selector-grid">

      <!-- TARJETA 1: SISTEMA ABIS -->
      <section class="system-selection-card card-theme-abis" id="card-abis">
        <div>
          <div class="card-header-row">
            <div class="card-icon-container icon-abis-box">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined">fingerprint</span>
            </div>
            <div class="card-title-block">
              <span class="badge-category badge-cat-abis">Identificación Biométrica</span>
              <div class="system-title-text">
                <span>ABIS</span>
                <span class="version-tag">v0.1.0</span>
              </div>
              <div class="system-subtitle-text">Control de Enrolamiento Biométrico</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card-body-content">
            <p class="card-description-paragraph">
              Plataforma institucional para auditoría pericial, reportería automatizada de extranjeros, monitoreo de flujos migratorios y control biométrico nacional.
            </p>

            <div class="features-list-title">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-list-check" style="color: var(--pdi-gold-dark);"></i>
              <span>Módulos Principales:</span>
            </div>
            <ul class="system-features-list">
              <li class="feature-item">
                <span class="feature-check check-abis"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i></span>
                <span>Auditoría de enrolamientos diarios, semanales y mensuales.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="feature-item">
                <span class="feature-check check-abis"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i></span>
                <span>Gráficos de flujo migratorio y tendencias históricas.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="feature-item">
                <span class="feature-check check-abis"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i></span>
                <span>Generación de minutas e informes en Word (.docx) y Excel (.xlsx).</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card-action-container">
          <% if (typeof user !== 'undefined' && user) { %>
            <a href="/abis" class="btn-system-portal btn-portal-abis" id="btn-ingreso-abis">
              <span>Ingresar al Panel ABIS</span>
              <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right btn-arrow-icon"></i>
            </a>
          <% } else { %>
            <a href="/login" class="btn-system-portal btn-portal-abis" id="btn-ingreso-abis">
              <span>Ingresar a Sistema ABIS</span>
              <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right btn-arrow-icon"></i>
            </a>
          <% } %>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- TARJETA 2: SISTEMA SIAD -->
      <section class="system-selection-card card-theme-siad" id="card-siad">
        <div>
          <div class="card-header-row">
